{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102161623242-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102163350\"/><p>今晨(2日)6時38分，西貢南山新村一獨立屋外傭報案，指發現一房間窗戶被撬，屋內有搜掠痕迹，懷疑遭賊人爆竊。警員接報到場，姓楊(75歲)男戶主經點算，證實一批手鐲、戒指、手錶及耳環等的財物被盜，價值約44萬港元。經初步調查後，案件列作爆竊跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:41:33.330115+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:16:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:18.691231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:38:45.207627+00:00","content_hash":"502022ac3b37f2696ec01b651070c66b616481d59aedaefe00bd0a2283f03da7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:41:33.330115+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}